<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Oroton says md Peter Nordish resigns.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Oroton says md Peter Nordish resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury leather and clothing goods maker Oroton International Ltd said Peter Nordish had been replaced as managing director by Ross Lane, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said Lane had been a director since December 1993.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for the resignation of Nordish, which was accepted on mutual and amicable terms.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
